# Going2Eat AWS deploy agent

When the user asks to push, deploy, cook, or upload this app to AWS:

1. Read and follow the personal Cursor skill `going2eat-deploy` (same as `going2eat-cook`). Those skills live in your Cursor skills folder, not in this app.
2. Read `.cursor/aws-deploy.json`
3. Follow `deploy-aws-app`: git push **main** (Amplify UI) + one Docker API image → ECR → ECS
4. Show target summary and wait for explicit consent
5. Never use dating cluster/ECR/domain names
6. There is no second Docker image for the Angular app
